@PrintDebateText Text:"但是，<br>现场只留下了希罗和<br><link=\"Objection_02_01_09_01\">梅露露的脚印</link>。<br>那里并没有其他脚印，<br>也没有<br><link=\"Objection_02_01_09_02\">可以用作落脚点的东西</link>……|#0201Trial09_Margo004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR7,ArmL5,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Neutral_Open
